                              {
                                "ctaId": "order-parts-online",
                                "label": "Shop Truck Parts Online →",
                                "style": "link"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-prepare",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "How to Prepare Your Fleet for an Annual DOT Inspection",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "prepare"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-prepare-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "To stay ahead of violations and keep your trucks performing at their best, consider building a consistent inspection routine into your operations.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-prepare-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Review the DOT inspection checklist monthly"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Keep detailed maintenance records"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Conduct internal commercial vehicle inspections"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Use high-quality parts"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Stay informed on DOT regulatory updates"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-prepare-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Early detection prevents last-minute surprises, documentation supports compliance and resale value, and brief weekly checks help teams spot issues between service visits. Cheap components may pass today but fail when it matters most, and FMCSA rules change, so partnering with an expert helps you stay compliant.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-trusted-partner",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why DOT Compliance Is Easier with a Trusted Service Partner",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "trusted-partner"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-trusted-partner-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, our service team works with fleets across Florida to prepare for annual truck inspections, troubleshoot issues, and keep vehicles road-ready between routine evaluations. The trucking industry depends heavily on reliable partners, and Sun State International has built its reputation on care, professionalism, and decades of hands-on expertise.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-trusted-partner-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What sets us apart is what our customers feel from the moment they walk in: straightforward service, honest communication, and a team that treats your business like it matters. Because to us, it does. We support your DOT readiness through:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-trusted-partner-3",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Certified technicians trained to meet and exceed International® standards"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Thorough fleet safety inspections aligned with FMCSA requirements"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "OEM and genuine parts that support long-term reliability"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Preventive maintenance scheduling designed to reduce downtime"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Quick, dependable turnaround because every hour your truck isn't running is money lost"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-trusted-partner-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "This level of service reflects who we are: a dependable, reputable, customer-first dealership built on transparency and care.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-2",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/img/blog/how-a-routine-dot-inspection-keeps-your-fleet-on-the-road/2.jpg",
                      "width": 1280,
                      "height": 853,
                      "alt": "Sun State International customers scheduling service at the front desk"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-get-inspection",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Get Your DOT Inspection with Sun State International",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "get-inspection"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-get-inspection-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A DOT inspection doesn't have to be stressful. With the right support, it becomes part of a dependable rhythm that keeps your fleet safe, compliant, and on the road. Whether you need preventive maintenance, a full commercial truck inspection, or high-quality parts, our team is here to help.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
